From 5fd0407441dcd5810a6a6b560564ddaf68eff9f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gu Chao <gux.chao@intel.com>
Date: Sun, 12 Apr 2020 19:33:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] DRV_DPM_SW-182: DPM Update EPON continuous Q allocation with
 new PPv4 API

- code refactoring to separate queue and scheduler handling
- add flag_ops to struct resv_info
